1. `public-key`Whether it was mistakenly filled in as the client public key;
2. `private-key`Whether it is the current client private key;
3. `pre-shared-key`Whether it is complete, and whether the trailing`=`is omitted;
4. `ip`Whether it is consistent with the address assigned to this peer by the server;
5. Whether the Endpoint domain name and port are correct;
6. Whether the soft router firewall has already allowed the WireGuard port;
7. Whether the standalone WireGuard client is still enabled\.
